<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of a committee shall hold office for such term as may be specified in his letter of appointment and is eligible for reappointment."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
