<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The Authority may, at any time, revoke the appointment of a member of a committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
