<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of a committee may, at any time, resign his office by a written notice addressed to the chairman of the committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
