<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The Authority may, at any time, discontinue the constitution or alter the composition of a committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
