<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "A committee may regulate its own procedure."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
