<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of the Authority or committee who fails to disclose his interest as required under subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
