<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister shall appoint a person who has scientific qualification, technical knowledge of and experience in the field of medical device or medical device related matters to be the Chief Executive on such terms and conditions as he thinks desirable."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
