<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "In the absence of the Chief Executive for any reason, the Minister shall appoint an officer of the Authority to carry out the duties of the Chief Executive."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
