<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
