<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, by order, make such modifications to the law referred to in subsection (1) in their application to such employee of the Government as may be necessary for the purpose of removing difficulties as a consequence of the provision of subsection."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
