<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_VI__cl_41> <https://schema.org/text> "All acts done by any person or authority on behalf of the Authority in preparation for or in anticipation of the enactment of this Act and any expenditure incurred in relation thereto, shall be deemed to have been authorized by this Act, provided that the acts and things done are consistent with the general intention and purposes of this Act; and all rights or obligations acquired or incurred on as a result of the doing of those acts or things including any expenditure incurred in relation thereto, shall on the coming into operation of this Act, be deemed to be the rights and obligations of the Authority."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
