<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_26__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The expenditure of the Authority up to such amount as may be authorized by the Minister for any one year shall be defrayed out of the Fund."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
