<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_26__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister shall, before 1 January the following year, notify the Authority of the amount authorized for expenditure generally or of the amount authorized for each description of expenditure based on the estimate prepared under subsection (2)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
