<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_26__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Authority may at any time submit to the Minister a supplementary estimate of its expenditure for any one year and the Minister may allow the whole or any part of the additional expenditure included therein. Bank accounts"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
