<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_27> <https://schema.org/text> "The Authority shall open and maintain an account or accounts with such financial institution or institutions in Malaysia as the Authority thinks fit, after consulting the Minister; and every such account shall be operated upon as far as practicable by cheques signed by any person or persons as may be authorized by the Authority for such purpose from time to time. Power to borrow"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
