<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_29> <https://schema.org/text> "The moneys of the Authority shall, in so far as they are not immediately required to be expended by the Authority under this Act, be invested in such manner as the Minister may, with the concurrence of the Minister of Finance, approve. Financial procedure"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
