<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Authority shall as soon as possible send a copy of the statement of accounts certified by the auditors and a copy of the auditor’s report to the Minister who shall cause such statement and report to be laid before both Houses of Parliament."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
