<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman shall call for a meeting if requested to do so in writing by the Minister or by at least two members of the Authority. Quorum"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
