<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman and four members of the Authority shall form a quorum at any meeting of the Authority. Casting vote"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~sched_1__para_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
