<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@/~sched_1__para_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If on any question to be determined by the Authority there is an equality of votes, the Chairman shall have a casting vote in addition to his deliberative vote. Authority may invite others to meetings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/12/eng@> .
